        "TileImage": "$($repository c5bc06fe-749f-42f0-a1ea-50e9e910277c).Image",
        "Description": "Good evening, 47.\r\rOur client is a former business partner of Club Hölle owner Rolf Hirschmüller, who recently discovered that Hirschmüller has been using the club as a front for a lucrative blackmail and extortion operation targeting Berlin&apos;s elite nightlife scene.\r\rThe client&apos;s attempts to expose the operation were met with intimidation and violence, orchestrated by Hirschmüller&apos;s trusted security personnel: Edgar Martin and Alexander Boesch.\r\rThe client wants all of them removed permanently.",
